title: "BioVanguard"
abstract: >-
  Integrated computational platform for MYC-focused ligand prioritization, coupling
  high-throughput molecular docking with graph-attention and XGBoost affinity prediction,
  embedding-based pose retrieval and interpretable web-based reporting.
